# {{PRODUCT_NAME}}

> {{TAGLINE}}

An AI-powered CLI built with the [Claude Agent SDK](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-typescript).

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Set your API key
export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-key

# Build
npm run build

# Link globally
npm link

# Run!
{{CLI_COMMAND}} --help
```

## Customization

Edit `src/branding.ts` to customize:
- Product name and tagline
- ASCII logo
- System prompt (Claude's personality)
- Default MCP servers

## Development

```bash
# Development mode (hot reload)
npm run dev

# Build
npm run build

# Type check
npm run typecheck
```

## Slash Commands

Type `/` to see available commands:
- `/help` - Show help
- `/clear` - Clear conversation
- `/model` - Change model
- `/think` - Toggle extended thinking
- And many more...

## Requirements

- Node.js 18+
- Anthropic API Key

